{"id":"7ed93be444b87576","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-lfp-model.md","title":"Herbrand Model","display":"thm-lfp-model — Herbrand Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-lfp-model","aliases":["57-thm-lfp-model"],"display":"thm-lfp-model — Herbrand Model","depends_on":["[[57-df-free-model]]","[[57-df-model]]","[[57-df-term-model]]","[[57-df-immediate-consequence]]","[[57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp]]","[[57-df-herbrand-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-lfp-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-lfp-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lfp-model — Herbrand Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"be9e6bea58d776c6\" href=\"?note=be9e6bea58d776c6\" title=\"57-df-free-model\">57-df-free-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4377db68f8b53b52\" href=\"?note=4377db68f8b53b52\" title=\"57-df-model\">57-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de630da3be5fd670\" href=\"?note=de630da3be5fd670\" title=\"57-df-term-model\">57-df-term-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"931bc3d500f82dff\" href=\"?note=931bc3d500f82dff\" title=\"57-df-immediate-consequence\">57-df-immediate-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"201c48982afc6187\" href=\"?note=201c48982afc6187\" title=\"57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp\">57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" href=\"?note=ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-structure\">57-df-herbrand-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span> 是固定字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的程序，每条子句的头与体原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；每条体有限，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 不必有限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_P=B_S\">\\(B_P=B_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P\">\\(T_P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"931bc3d500f82dff\" href=\"?note=931bc3d500f82dff\" title=\"57-df-immediate-consequence\">57-df-immediate-consequence</a>。 假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H_I(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak H_I(S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" href=\"?note=ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-structure\">57-df-herbrand-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lfp}\">\\(\\mathrm{lfp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_P^n\">\\(T_P^n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"201c48982afc6187\" href=\"?note=201c48982afc6187\" title=\"57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp\">57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_P\">\\(M_P\\)</span> 是最小模型的真基原子集合，不把该集合与结构有序对混同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\models P\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak H_I(S)\\models P\\quad(I\\subseteq B_P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\models P\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak H_I(S)\\models P\\quad(I\\subseteq B_P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_P\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:I\\models P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_P\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{I\\subseteq B_P:I\\models P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_P=\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_P^n(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\mathfrak H_{M_P}(S)\\models P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_P=\\mathrm{lfp}(T_P)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T_P^n(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\mathfrak H_{M_P}(S)\\models P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-free-model","status":"resolved","id":"be9e6bea58d776c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"4377db68f8b53b52","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"de630da3be5fd670","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-immediate-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-immediate-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"201c48982afc6187","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-knaster-tarski-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ff7a0658d8cf65f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-immediate-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"931bc3d500f82d